    "text": "Adam \u00fea leofode on geswince nigon hund geara & \u00ferittig geara.\n& he \u00fea for\u00f0ferde for his forg\u00e6dednysse & his sawul si\u00f0ode sarig to helle.\n& eall his ofspring eall swa ferde o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t Crist us alysde of \u00feam cwearterne eft.\nMycel yfell manncynne swi\u00f0e swa \u00fe\u00e6t hi God gremodon & swi\u00f0ost mid forligre unalyfedlice swa \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00d0eah feawa \u00e6tforan Criste rihtwise swa swa Abel & Enoch & Noe on \u00feam is seo forme yld \u00feissere\nGemaca nu for\u00feig \u00e6nne eall gerefedne.\nIc wille adrencan & adydan eall \u00feis mennisc mid w\u00e6tere buton & \u00feinum \u00ferim sunum & eowrum\nGe eahta sceolon wunian & of eallum nytenum ic gegaderie into eow \u00fe\u00e6t ge magon to fostre \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6t\nNoe \u00fea geworhte \u00feone wundorlic him oninnan \u00e6r\u00feam \u00fee \u00feat flod come mid his \u00ferim sunum, Sem,\n& God him sende swa swa he him of eallum nytenum & of fugelcynne symle gemacan & beleac\nGod asende \u00f0a sona \u00e6nne swi\u00f0licne scur feowertig daga onan & eac \u00fea w\u00e6ter\u00feeotan \u00fe\u00e6re widgillan\nNoes sunan \u00f0a sy\u00f0\u00fean gestryndon & hund seofontig sunana \u00fea woldon sona wyrcean mid heora\nHi h\u00e6fdon \u00fea gyt ealle \u00fe\u00e6t Ebreisce gereord & God com & sceawode \u00feone stypell & forgeaf \u00feam\n\u00c6fter \u00feissum wear\u00f0 wolice afunden swi\u00f0e mycel on \u00feam manncynne \u00fe\u00e6t menn worhton him godas of\nMancynne to forwyrde & hi geb\u00e6don to him mid gebigedum & forsawon heora scyppend \u00fee hi\nAbraham se \u00fee com of yldestan suna.\nHi ane gelyfdon on \u00feone \u00e6lmihtig \u00feeah \u00f0e hi of ldeabugon to hearme himsylfum.\nHi sume \u00feurh deade entas \u00feurh deofles lare ac beswycon sang se witiga, Quoniam omnes dii gentium\nGodas ne mihton nan\u00feing gescyppan \u00fe\u00e6t\u00fee \u00e6r\u00f0an n\u00e6s \u00f0e ma for\u00fean \u00fee an God is ealr